WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.500
This one is about maps.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.375
A table of countries hides
where things really happen.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.720
And most maps draw every place
as the same little dot.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.587
Here, maps start from the real ground:
mountains, rivers and lakes.

5
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.720
Every line is drawn by our own code,
on a projection chosen for the region.

6
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.160
Then the story goes on top:
who holds what, and where.

7
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.162
The legend sits in the quiet corner,
never on the action.

8
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.150
The secret: conflict data says
how precise each location is.

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.280
A precise place gets a solid dot.
A rough one gets a hollow ring.

10
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.879
4 actors, one clear legend,
and a country you recognise at a glance.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
